      "operations": "All callable IDs/signatures are identical across metadata views. Rich metadata explains preconditions; it does not enable more powerful execution. Use cumulative/interval/daily operations only on evidenced values; return abstention for unavailable observations, undefined normalization or insufficient representations. Independent analog labels remain unavailable.",
